    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:verse_call",
      "text": [
        "Sixteen verses, and no wire. A **Verse Call** listens to redstone; a **Verse Answer** within 32 blocks, tuned to the same verse, sings it back out."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Tuning a pair",
      "text": [
        "Snap a Verse Call onto any block face. It hears redstone from **every side except its facing**.",
        "Snap a Verse Answer onto a face within **32 blocks**, in the same world. It sings out of its facing, into the block in front of it.",
        "Crouch and use either plate to step its verse from **1 to 16**; both must match. Right-click with an empty hand to read the verse and the strength.",
        "The Answer copies the strength the Call hears, so it is not always 15. When several Calls share a verse, the Answer takes the loudest. A mismatched verse stays silent."
      ]
    },
